The start is 2, while the target is 3.
The steps is 0, while the current is target.
Repeat while current is more than start.
If current modulo 2 is 0 and current divided by 2 is at least start, set current to current divided by 2.
Otherwise, set current to current plus 1.
Add 1 to steps.

Set steps to steps plus current minus start.
Show steps.
